--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
=== SUMMARY ===
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
data sources : 4 reads bound as StateFlow via BatteryHealthPageViewModel -> batteryHealthPageSourceOf():
               EnergyStore.batteryHealthAnalytics (web useBatteryHealthAnalytics, PRIMARY gate) + EnergyStore.batteryDegradation
               (web useBatteryDegradation), and the page-local BatteryExtrasRepository.chargingSessions/chargingTelemetryLatest
               over the shared ApiHttpClient + CacheStore (web useChargingSessionsPaginated / useChargingTelemetryLatest).
               Scope = SelectedVehicleStore (web useSelectedVehicle); units = SettingsStore.settings() (web useUnits). No HTTP in the view.
charts       : 4x RadialGauge + 3x ChartContainer + ComboChart (web ComposedChart) + AreaChartWrapper + BarChartWrapper from the
               A3 components.charts (Vico) library; the AC/DC pie is a Compose-Canvas donut + legend authored in the page (A3 ships
               no pie wrapper) — Compose-native, never a webview.
si/units     : SI read off the wire; range history km->display via convertDistanceFromSI(km*1000) (prefs.fromKm), module temps
               C->display via convertTempFromSI (prefs.temperature), session energy Wh->kWh via convertEnergyFromSI. Battery
               capacity is kWh on the wire and rendered verbatim (web parity). No miles/°F/psi stored or computed.
states       : battery-health is the PRIMARY gate (loading/empty/error/success). Each secondary feed renders its own
               content-or-empty surface (insights.empty, chart noTrend/noRange/noSessions/noBreakdown, stats.empty, thermal/full-charge
               em dashes), so no section is ever hidden (web per-section truthiness). Documented divergence (Honesty #9): an
               all-zero / no-vehicle battery payload routes to the friendly empty surface via the model hasData gate; and the 10
               section.*Failed titles back a SectionBoundary (web SectionErrorBoundary port) whose failure card surfaces on a
               secondary-feed hard-error (telemetry/sessions, no cache) and is otherwise the always-resolved fallback title — a
               reasonable adaptation of web's render-crash-only boundary since Compose has no composition error boundary here.
a11y/theme   : charts carry accessibleDescription (the web aria-labels); the pie carries a merged contentDescription + a TalkBack
               legend; gauges expose a merged contentDescription; icons decorative (contentDescription=null); all color via
